{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09603","headline":"冬宵家会饯李郎司兵赴同州 · 岑参","name":"冬宵家会饯李郎司兵赴同州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"急管杂青丝，玉瓶金屈巵。\n寒天高堂夜，扑地飞雪时。\n贺君关西掾，新绶腰下垂。\n白面皇家郎，逸翮青云姿。\n明旦之官去，他辰良会稀。\n惜别冬夜短，务欢盃行迟。\n季女犹自小，老夫未令归。\n且看匹马行，不得鸣凤飞。\n昔岁到冯翊，人烟接京师。\n曾上月楼头，遥见西岳祠。\n沙苑逼官舍，莲峰压城池。\n多暇或自公，读书复弹棊。\n州县信徒劳，云霄亦可期。\n应须力爲政，聊慰此相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}